-- הסכם קיבוצי — תיקון הסכם 2016 (8.8.2016): the same parties amend the
-- public-sector framework agreement of 18.4.2016 ("הסכם 2016"), as the
-- follow-up committee's decision of 2.8.2016 amended it. The cost frame
-- grows to 7.75% (1.55% a year) against later allocation days: 4.25% from
-- 1.6.2018, 6% from 1.12.2018 and 7.75% from 1.3.2019 (§5.1), and so the
-- special supplements (§9.2), the defaults (§§13–15, the last now 1.75% and
-- +0.875% to 3.875%) and the index-linked supplements (§16.1); annex ד' is
-- to be replaced by one agreed later; the pensioners' window runs to
-- 28.2.2019, with a new annex ו' (§19); the social workers' frame is 7.54%
-- (§21); the local-government agreement of 14.7.2016 is to be adjusted
-- (§15); a new accession letter (§16); everything else stands (§17).
--
-- Encoded as an amendment: it imports the framework agreement's module
-- (2016-04-18_framework-agreement_public-sector) and states each rule it
-- changes as a rule of its own, calling the framework's rule for the time
-- before or what it leaves. Nothing of the framework is copied. Like the
-- framework, it covers no teaching employee and is in no root. The
-- September 2016 Ofek Hadash agreement recites it; the 2016 round is held
-- against it in l4/tests/2016-09-30_ofek-hadash_september-2016-agreement-tests.l4.
--
-- The corpus numbers its sections 1, 2 and then 13–17, as the copy prints
-- them; the numbers are the corpus's and are cited as they stand.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `2016-04-18_framework-agreement_public-sector`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תיקון הסכם 2016 (8.8.2016)`

DECLARE `2016 amendment action` IS ONE OF
    `agree an amended annex ד' fitted to the amended frame`
    `agree changes to the local-government agreement fitted to the amended frame`
    `sign the amended accession letter again`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp (15.12.2016, nos. 7036/2016 and 224/2016); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The State, by the acting wages commissioner or the Civil Service Commissioner, and for the defence plants the bodies authorised to sign for them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The Centre of Regional Councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The Union of Religious Councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The National Insurance Institute; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The Employment Service; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The Hebrew University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 Bar-Ilan University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 Ben-Gurion University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The University of Haifa, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 Tel Aviv University, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The Technion, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 The Weizmann Institute, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The Hadassah Medical Organisation; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p20 Clalit Health Services; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p21 Israel Post; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p22 The Jewish Agency, for itself and the national institutions, its representative left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p23 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p24 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p25 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p26 The Histadrut and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p27 The Histadrut's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p28 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p31 A recital: the parties anchor what they agreed in a collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p32 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: the day of signing.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the 2016 framework amendment was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 8 8 2016

-- ¶29: the framework agreement of 18.4.2016 (imported), as the follow-up
-- committee's decision of 2.8.2016 amended it ("הסכם 2016"); the decision
-- is not in the corpus. ¶30: the parties negotiated raising the frame for
-- the period to 7.75% in all, in place of 7.5%, against putting off part of
-- its allocation days.
@ref akn:preamble/p29
`the agreement the 2016 amendment amends was signed on` MEANS `the 2016 framework agreement was signed on`
`the follow-up committee's decision the 2016 amendment recites` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 2 8 2016

@ref akn:preamble/p30
`the 2016 frame raised to, by the recital` MEANS 7.75%

§§ `1–2 מבוא ותיקון הסכם 2016`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.
-- akn:art_2 The heading of §2.

-- §1 ¶1: the preamble is part of the agreement. ¶2: its headings are for
-- convenience only and do not bear on its reading.
@ref akn:art_1/p1
`the 2016 amendment's preamble is part of it` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_1/p2
`the 2016 amendment's headings bear on its reading` MEANS FALSE

-- §2 ¶1: these changes are made in "הסכם 2016". (א): §4 is replaced: the
-- frame for 1.1.2013–31.12.2017 is 7.75%, 1.55% for each of 2013–2017,
-- allocated by §5's days.
@ref akn:art_2/p1 akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_a/p2
`the 2016 framework cost frame in all, as amended` MEANS 7.75%
`the 2016 framework cost frame for each year, as amended` MEANS 1.55%

#ASSERT 5 TIMES `the 2016 framework cost frame for each year, as amended` EQUALS `the 2016 framework cost frame in all, as amended`
#ASSERT `the 2016 framework cost frame in all, as amended` EQUALS `the 2016 frame raised to, by the recital`

-- (ב): in 5.1, 5.1.3–5.1.5 are replaced: from 1.6.2018 to 4.25%, from
-- 1.12.2018 to 6%, from 1.3.2019 to 7.75%, each on 6.1's base. 5.1.1 and
-- 5.1.2 stand (the framework's, imported).
@ref akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b/p2
`the steps of the 2016 framework, as amended` MEANS
    append (take 2 `the steps of the 2016 framework`)
           (LIST `2016 framework step` "5.1.3" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018) (4.25%),
                 `2016 framework step` "5.1.4" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2018) (6%),
                 `2016 framework step` "5.1.5" (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) (7.75%))

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` d IS
    foldl (GIVEN acc, s YIELD IF d `is on or after` (s's `the step's day`) THEN s's `completed to` ELSE acc) 0 `the steps of the 2016 framework, as amended`

GIVEN s IS A `2016 framework step`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what an amended 2016 step adds` s IS
    s's `completed to` MINUS `the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` (DATE_FROM_SERIAL (DATE_SERIAL (s's `the step's day`) MINUS 1))

#ASSERT map `what an amended 2016 step adds` `the steps of the 2016 framework, as amended` EQUALS LIST 1%, 1.75%, 1.5%, 1.75%, 1.75%
#ASSERT `the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) EQUALS `the 2016 framework cost frame in all, as amended`
-- The amendment puts the steps off: from 1.1.2018 to 1.3.2019 the amended
-- allocation is below the signed one, and never above it.
#ASSERT `the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018) EQUALS 2.75%
#ASSERT `the 2016 framework allocation on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018) EQUALS 4.25%

-- (ג): in 7.2(ג) and 11.5, in place of annex ד' (as the follow-up
-- committee's decision of 2.8.2016 replaced it), an amended annex ד' the
-- State and the Histadrut will agree, fitted to the amended frame. Neither
-- the decision's annex nor the amended one is in the corpus: the special
-- scales' tables from the signing on are a gap of the text.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c akn:art_2__para_c/p2
`agreeing the amended annex ד'` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `agree an amended annex ד' fitted to the amended frame`

`why the special scales' tables of 2016 are not here, as amended` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "נספח ד' המתוקן שיסוכם בין המדינה להסתדרות, ונספח ד' כפי שהוחלף בהחלטת ועדת המעקב מיום 2.8.2016"

-- (ד): in 9.2, 9.2.3–9.2.5 are replaced: the special supplements to 4.25%
-- from 1.6.2018, to 6% from 1.12.2018, to 7.75% from 1.3.2019, of the base
-- sum — the amended frame's days and figures.
@ref akn:art_2__para_d akn:art_2__para_d/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the base sum` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a special supplement of 2016 as amended on` d `the base sum` IS
    `the base sum` `increased by` (`the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` d)

#ASSERT `a special supplement of 2016 as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) 1000 EQUALS 1077.5

-- (ה): §13's heading and first paragraph are replaced: where by 31.3.2018
-- no agreement allocates 5.1.3's cost, on 1.6.2018 1.5% is allocated; (א)
-- — +0.75% to 2.125% — and (ב) stand; ¶3: (ג) is replaced: paid from the
-- June 2018 salary, at the latest July's. (ו): §14's heading and first
-- paragraph: by 30.9.2018, on 1.12.2018, 1.75%; (א) — +0.875% to 3% — and
-- (ב) stand; ¶3: (ג), the December 2018 salary, at the latest January
-- 2019's. (ז): §15 is replaced whole: by 31.12.2018, on 1.3.2019, 1.75%:
-- (א) +0.875% to 3.875%; (ב) the rest to the shekel supplement by A + B = C,
-- D as 12.2(ב) and E 15(א)'s rise, 12.2(ג) with 5.1.5; (ג) the March 2019
-- salary, at the latest April's.
@ref akn:art_2__para_e akn:art_2__para_e/p2 akn:art_2__para_e/p3 akn:art_2__para_f akn:art_2__para_f/p2 akn:art_2__para_f/p3 akn:art_2__para_g akn:art_2__para_g/p2
`the defaults of the 2016 framework, as amended` MEANS
    append (take 1 `the defaults of the 2016 framework`)
           (LIST `2016 framework default` "5.1.3" (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 3 2018) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018) (1.5%) (0.75%),
                 `2016 framework default` "5.1.4" (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 9 2018) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2018) (1.75%) (0.875%),
                 `2016 framework default` "5.1.5" (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2018) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) (1.75%) (0.875%))

-- Each amended default's cost is what its amended step adds, on its day.
GIVEN f IS A `2016 framework default`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an amended 2016 default is its step` f IF
    any (GIVEN s YIELD     s's `the step's clause` EQUALS f's `the default's step`
                       AND s's `the step's day` EQUALS f's `the default's day`
                       AND `what an amended 2016 step adds` s EQUALS f's `the default's cost`)
        `the steps of the 2016 framework, as amended`

#ASSERT all `an amended 2016 default is its step` `the defaults of the 2016 framework, as amended`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the steps agreed in time` IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2016 percentage supplement rate by default as amended on` d `the steps agreed in time` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN f YIELD f's `the percentage it adds`)
             (filter (GIVEN f YIELD     d `is on or after` (f's `the default's day`)
                                    AND NOT elem (f's `the default's step`) `the steps agreed in time`)
                     `the defaults of the 2016 framework, as amended`))

#ASSERT `the 2016 percentage supplement rate by default as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2018) EMPTY EQUALS 1.375%
#ASSERT `the 2016 percentage supplement rate by default as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2018) EMPTY EQUALS 2.125%
#ASSERT `the 2016 percentage supplement rate by default as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2018) EMPTY EQUALS 3%
#ASSERT `the 2016 percentage supplement rate by default as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) EMPTY EQUALS 3.875%

-- (ח): 16.1 is replaced: the index-linked supplements on the amended days
-- and figures — 1% from 1.7.2016, to 2.75% from 1.3.2017, to 4.25% from
-- 1.6.2018, to 6% from 1.12.2018, to 7.75% from 1.3.2019 — of their sum on
-- the eve of "this agreement's" signing.
@ref akn:art_2__para_h akn:art_2__para_h/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `the base of the supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an index-linked supplement brought forward as amended on` d `the base of the supplement` IS
    `the base of the supplement` `increased by` (`the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` d)

#ASSERT `an index-linked supplement brought forward as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) 200 EQUALS `a special supplement of 2016 as amended on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2019) 200

§§ `13–17 גמלאים, עובדים סוציאליים, השלטון המקומי וכתב ההצטרפות`

-- akn:art_13 The heading of §13: in §19 of the 2016 agreement.
-- akn:art_14 The heading of §14: in §21 of the 2016 agreement.
-- akn:art_15 The heading of §15: on the local-government agreement.
-- akn:art_16 The heading of §16: on the accession letter.

-- §13 ¶1: 19.1.1 is replaced: the eligible retiree is one who retired
-- from 1 January 2013 to 28 February 2019 in a scale of annex ה'. ¶3: in
-- 19.1.6, 28 February 2019 in place of 30 November 2018 for the land
-- authority's retirees.
@ref akn:art_13/p1
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE, `in an annex ה' scale on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible retiree under the 2016 framework as amended` `retired on` `in an annex ה' scale on the eve` IF
        `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013)
    AND `retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2019)
    AND `in an annex ה' scale on the eve`

@ref akn:art_13/p3
GIVEN `retired on` IS A DATE, `in the land authority's scale on the eve` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an eligible land-authority retiree under the 2016 framework as amended` `retired on` `in the land authority's scale on the eve` IF
        `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2013)
    AND `retired on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 28 2 2019)
    AND `in the land authority's scale on the eve`

-- ¶2: in 19.1.2, 19.1.5, 19.1.6 and 19.5, the amended annex ו' attached
-- here replaces the framework's, fitted to the amended frame and days. Its
-- coefficient is the framework's rule on the amended allocation: a month
-- of service in 2013–2017 earns a sixtieth, less the share the retiree had
-- while serving, up to the share the amended frame has reached.
@ref akn:art_13/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the coefficient X of 2016 as amended on` d `for a retiree of` y m IS
    `not below zero`
        ((IF `the amended share allocated on` d LESS THAN `the share of the 2016 frame earned by` y m
          THEN `the amended share allocated on` d
          ELSE `the share of the 2016 frame earned by` y m)
         MINUS `the amended share allocated on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 m y))

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the amended share allocated on` d IS
    `the 2016 framework allocation as amended on` d DIVIDED BY `the 2016 framework cost frame in all, as amended`

-- §14: in §21, 7.54% in place of 7.29%: the social workers' frame, the
-- expertise pay's 0.21% off the amended 7.75%.
@ref akn:art_14/p1
`the social workers' 2016 frame, as amended` MEANS 7.54%

#ASSERT `the social workers' 2016 frame, as amended` EQUALS `the 2016 framework cost frame in all, as amended` MINUS `the expertise-pay cut of the 2016 frame`

-- §15: further to §20 and to the "2%" agreement of 18.4.2016 between the
-- local-government employers and the Histadrut (a further 2% frame), the
-- agreement of 14.7.2016 divided both frames among their employees ("the
-- local-government agreement"); its changes, fitted to 7.75% and the new
-- days, will be agreed later. Neither agreement is in the corpus.
@ref akn:art_15/p1
`adjusting the local-government agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `agree changes to the local-government agreement fitted to the amended frame`

`the local-government "2%" frame` MEANS 2%

`why the local-government agreements are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "ההסכם הקיבוצי מיום 18.4.2016 (\"הסכם 2%\") וההסכם מיום 14.7.2016 בשלטון המקומי"

-- §16 ¶1: the amended accession letter attached replaces annex ב'. ¶2: an
-- employer that signed the old one must sign the amended one for the
-- changes to reach it.
@ref akn:art_16/p1 akn:art_16/p2
GIVEN `signed the old letter` IS A BOOLEAN, `signed the amended letter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2016 amendment reaches a joining employer` `signed the old letter` `signed the amended letter` IF
    `signed the amended letter`

-- §17: everything else in the 2016 agreement stands unchanged.
@ref akn:art_17
`the 2016 amendment leaves the rest of the framework as it was` MEANS TRUE

