         `amended annex ו' row` 8 2013 8 (13.33%) (LIST (12.90%), (13.33%), (13.33%), (13.33%), (13.33%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 9 2013 9 (15.00%) (LIST (12.90%), (15.00%), (15.00%), (15.00%), (15.00%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 10 2013 10 (16.67%) (LIST (12.90%), (16.67%), (16.67%), (16.67%), (16.67%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 11 2013 11 (18.33%) (LIST (12.90%), (18.33%), (18.33%), (18.33%), (18.33%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 12 2013 12 (20.00%) (LIST (12.90%), (20.00%), (20.00%), (20.00%), (20.00%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 13 2014 1 (21.67%) (LIST (12.90%), (21.67%), (21.67%), (21.67%), (21.67%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 14 2014 2 (23.33%) (LIST (12.90%), (23.33%), (23.33%), (23.33%), (23.33%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 15 2014 3 (25.00%) (LIST (12.90%), (25.00%), (25.00%), (25.00%), (25.00%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 16 2014 4 (26.67%) (LIST (12.90%), (26.67%), (26.67%), (26.67%), (26.67%)),
         `amended annex ו' row` 17 2014 5 (28.33%) (LIST (12.90%), (28.33%), (28.33%), (28.33%), (28.33%)),
